			"notes": "### Bee Tutorial Structure 1.1.0\n\nAdds a New Structure: The Bee Tutorial.\n\nTeaches the player about honey, bottling it, shearing beehives, the usage of campfires for bee hives, and gives a hint towards the ability for bees to boost plant growth!\n\nShould work on the 4 main MC modloaders (Fabric Forge Neoforge Quilt)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/friedegg796/TutorialStructures/compare/1.0.2-lowcodeallmodloaders-1.20.1...1.1.0-beetutorial-1.20.X\n\nPlease do give issues to https://github.com/friedegg796/TutorialStructures/issues\nAnd give me suggestions on what structure to add next to teach the player!"
		},
